        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Mul-T-Lock 206S-HD1-THK Hercular Thick Door Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWith its truly unique design the MUL-T-LOCK Hercular thick door deadbolt is truly spectacular high security lock. The Hercular thick door deadbolt lock is reinforced in just about every way possible. From a UL437 Listed lock cylinder, to strong latch, to Bolt Bearing Mechanism, the Hercular Deadbolt will stop almost any attempt at forced entry. Strength usually does not mix with Flexibility. Not in the case of the Hercular, since it is a best rated Grade 1 Deadbolt, with an adjustable backset. The Hercular deadbolt is true <b>high security lock</b> that exceeds all high security standards.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis is a Single Cylinder (Key on outside and Thumb Turn inside) Deadbolt and is available in 7 different finishes. Supplied with two (2) keys and owner key card. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/grade-1-mul-t-lock-hercular-single-cylinder-deadbolt\"><b>Standard Hercular Deadbolt</b></a> - <a href=\"/products/mul-t-lock-double-cylinder-thick-door-deadbolt-206sp-hd2-thk\"><b>Hercular Double Cylinder Thick Door Deadbolt</b></a>. Please see <a href=\"/collections/thick-door-locks\">Thick Door Locks</a> and our guide on <a href=\"/pages/how-to-choose-the-best-deadbolt\">how to choose the best deadbolt</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMUL-T-LOCK's deadbolts are designed to provide superior door protection with uncompromised key control. The Key Card owner is the only person allowed to have the keys duplicated. Remove the worry about anyone making duplicates of your keys. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features </b> for Mul-T-Lock 206S-HD1-THK Thick Door Deadbolt\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/2\" to 4-1/4\" Thick Door</li>\r\n<li>Fits 2-1/8\" Standard Bore Hole</li>\r\n<li>ANSI Grade 1 Locking Mechanism</li>\r\n<li>Bump Proof Lock Design</li>\r\n<li>Mul-T-Lock 206SP Security Keyway</li>\r\n<li>2 Keys per Lock</li>\r\n<li>UL Fire Rated Latch</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable Backset fits 2-3/8\" and  2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>UL437 Drill and Pick Resistance Lock Cylinder</li>\r\n<li>Door frame strike reinforced with 3\" screws for extra security</li>\r\n<li><b>ADA Compliant</b></li>\r\n<li>MUL-T-LOCK's Patented Interactive Key Control System</li>\r\n<li>Limited Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: For use with <b>1-1/2\" to 4-1/4\" Thick Doors</b>.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Mul-T-Lock Hercular Thick Door Deadbolt, 206SP-HD1-THK",
                "description": "Mul-T-Lock 206SP-HD1-THK Hercular Thick Door Deadbolts. High Security Grade 1 restricted key thick door deadbolts. Single cylinder (key on outside and thumb turn on inside) with adjustable backset. For doors 1-1/2 to 4-1/4 inches  thick. Available in 7 different finishes.  The Mul-T-Lock Hercular deadbolt is true high security lock that exceeds all high security standards.",
                "keywords": "MTL-206S-HD1-THK Hercular Thick Door Deadbolts, Bump Proof Single Cylinder Deadbolts,  thick door locks, KW-HD1 Mul-T-Lock Hercular Single Cylinder Deadbolts, Mul-T-Lock Deadbolts, Security locks, Grade 1 locks, commercial deadbolts, Mul-T-Lock Hercular deadbolts, pick proof locks, High Security Single Cylinder Deadbolts, Mul-T-Lock restricted keyway, Mul-T-Lock restricted keys,"
